            "mapper": {
                "ca": "",
                "qs": [],
                "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
                "data": "{\"model\":\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\"max_tokens\":5000,\"system\":\"You are an automated used car deal scanner AND formatter for Syndicate Solutions Sri Lanka.\\n\\nPART 1 - SEARCH & ANALYZE:\\nBudget: LKR 5,000,000. Target: Suzuki Alto 800, Wagon R, Honda Fit GP1/GP5, Toyota Aqua, Nissan Dayz, Toyota Vitz, Honda Vezel.\\nSearch: 1) site:riyasewana.com/buy suzuki alto 800 colombo 2014 2015 2016 2) site:riyasewana.com/buy honda fit gp1 colombo low mileage 3) site:riyasewana.com/buy toyota aqua colombo western province 4) site:ikman.lk/en/ad/ suzuki alto 800 colombo urgent negotiable\\nExtract URLs: riyasewana.com/buy/[slug]-[ID] or ikman.lk/en/ad/[slug]-[ID] only. Skip any ID in EXCLUDED list.\\nROI: Alto 800 LXI CVT 2015-16 80-100k: 4.1M | 2014 90-110k: 3.7M | Wagon R FX 2016-17 60-90k: 5M | Fit GP1 2012-13 80-110k: 6.8M | Fit GP5 2014-15 70-100k: 7.5M | Aqua S 2013-14 80-100k: 8M | Aqua S 2015 60-90k: 9M | Dayz S/X 2015-16 50-80k: 5.8M | Vitz F 2014-15 60-90k: 5.5M | Vezel Hybrid 2015 80-100k: 9M. Score = ((Market - Ask) / Market) * 100 +8 private +5 per distress -20 if >120k km -10 if outside Colombo/Western -5 if dealer. Cap 100. Discard negative base ROI. Est profit = Market - Ask - 150k. Rank top 4 by ROI.\\n\\nPART 2 - OUTPUT FORMAT (output ONLY the three tags below, absolutely no other text before or after):\\n[[HEADER_MSG]]\\n{\\\"embeds\\\":[{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Syndicate Solutions Auto-Scanner\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"**Date:** DATE | **Deals:** N | **Total Ask:** LKR X | NOTE\\\",\\\"color\\\":16096779,\\\"footer\\\":{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Syndicate Solutions Auto-Scanner\\\"}}]}\\n[[/HEADER_MSG]]\\n[[DEALS_MSG]]\\n{\\\"embeds\\\":[{\\\"title\\\":\\\"#RANK | YEAR MAKE MODEL\\\",\\\"color\\\":COLOR,\\\"fields\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Asking Price\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"LKR X,XXX,XXX\\\",\\\"inline\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Market Value\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"LKR X,XXX,XXX\\\",\\\"inline\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"ROI Score\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"XX/100\\\",\\\"inline\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Est. Profit\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"LKR X,XXX,XXX\\\",\\\"inline\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Mileage\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"XXX,XXX km\\\",\\\"inline\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Transmission\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Auto\\\",\\\"inline\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Location\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"City - SellerType\\\",\\\"inline\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Why Buy\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"point 1\\\\npoint 2\\\",\\\"inline\\\":false},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Risks\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"risk\\\",\\\"inline\\\":false},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Listing URL\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"https://...\\\",\\\"inline\\\":false}]}]}\\n[[/DEALS_MSG]]\\n[[SEEN_IDS]]\\nID1,ID2,ID3,ID4\\n[[/SEEN_IDS]]\\nColors: rank 1=16096779, ranks 2-3=1096065, rank 4=7041664. If no qualifying deals found: [[DEALS_MSG]]{\\\"embeds\\\":[{\\\"title\\\":\\\"No New Deals\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"No new underpriced listings.\\\",\\\"color\\\":7041664}]}[[/DEALS_MSG]] and [[SEEN_IDS]][[/SEEN_IDS]].\",\"tools\":[{\"type\":\"web_search_20250305\",\"name\":\"web_search\"}],\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Scan now. Budget LKR 5,000,000. EXCLUDED IDs: {{1.value}}. Output ONLY the three tags with real listing data.\"}]}",
